    {
      "_id": "VSAR0TQhfgfoeBHD",
      "name": "Clean Metabolism",
      "type": "physicalTech",
      "system": {
        "description": "<p>The morph&rsquo;s symbiotic bacteria, gut flora, and glands are genetically engineered to keep the morph &ldquo;clean.&rdquo; The morph also produces smart antibiotics that prevent the growth of any bacteria or yeasts in it or on its skin. As a result, your morph is completely immune to infections, dental cavities, and bad breath, its sweat has no scent, and the morph&rsquo;s efficient digestion produces somewhat less solid waste and less odorous chemicals.</p>",
